                                                        .appTheme
                                                        .darkWhiteColor,
                                                    BlendMode.srcIn,
                                                  ),
                                                  height: 25,
                                                ),
                                              ),
                                            )
                                            : const SizedBox.shrink()
                                        : const SizedBox.shrink(),
                                  ],
